Description: Node.js 24 as the default node on PATH
 Puts node, npm and npx on PATH, pointing at node-24, npm-24 and npx-24.
 Provides nodejs so Procursus npm's Depends: nodejs is satisfied, and
 replaces the bootstrap's npm 8.1.1.
